  "docTitle": "Design a Message Queue - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design Kafka from scratch: partitioned append-only logs, segment files and sparse indexes, leader-follower replication with ISR and high watermark, acks and min.insync.replicas, pull consumers and consumer groups, offsets, exactly-once, retention, compaction, tiered storage, KRaft and queue-style share groups.",
  "hero": {
