    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span><span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span><span class=\"chip docker\">Docker</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Walmart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Google</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Design a Message Queue (Kafka itself)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Build a distributed message queue from an empty whiteboard: one append-only file, then partitions, replicas, consumer groups, offsets, retention and a controller. Every piece is a decision you can defend, and at the end you will see that you have re-invented Kafka, and know why each part exists.</p>\n      "
